{"suttaId":"tha-ap504","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[2999,3034],"vripara":"39"},"segments":{"tha-ap504:0.3":"Ekapattadāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap504:1.1":"“Nagare haṃsavatiyā, kumbhakāro ahosahaṃ;","tha-ap504:1.3":"Addasaṃ virajaṃ buddhaṃ, oghatiṇṇamanāsavaṃ.","tha-ap504:2.1":"“Sukataṃ mattikāpattaṃ, buddhaseṭṭhassadāsahaṃ;","tha-ap504:2.3":"Pattaṃ datvā bhagavato, ujubhūtassa tādino.","tha-ap504:3.1":"“Bhave nibbattamānohaṃ, soṇṇathāle labhāmahaṃ;","tha-ap504:3.3":"Rūpimaye ca sovaṇṇe, taṭṭike ca maṇīmaye.","tha-ap504:4.1":"“Pātiyo paribhuñjāmi, puññakammassidaṃ phalaṃ;","tha-ap504:4.3":"Yasānañca dhanānañca [yasasāva janānañca (syā.)], aggabhūto [pattabhūto (sī. pī.)] ca homahaṃ.","tha-ap504:5.1":"“Yathāpi bhaddake khette, bījaṃ appampi ropitaṃ;","tha-ap504:5.3":"Sammādhāraṃ pavacchante, phalaṃ toseti kassakaṃ.","tha-ap504:6.1":"“Tathevidaṃ pattadānaṃ, buddhakhettamhi ropitaṃ;","tha-ap504:6.3":"Pītidhāre pavassante, phalaṃ maṃ tosayissati.","tha-ap504:7.1":"“Yāvatā khettā vijjanti, saṅghāpi ca gaṇāpi ca;","tha-ap504:7.3":"Buddhakhettasamo natthi, sukhado sabbapāṇinaṃ.","tha-ap504:8.1":"“Namo te purisājañña, namo te purisuttama;","tha-ap504:8.3":"Ekapattaṃ daditvāna, pattomhi acalaṃ padaṃ.","tha-ap504:9.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, yaṃ pattamadadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap504:9.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, pattadānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap504:10.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap504:11.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap504:12.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap504:13.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ekapattadāyako thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap504:14.1":"Ekapattadāyakattherassāpadānaṃ dutiyaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
